cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use FRAMED, please cite the paper under 'preferred-citation'. FRAMED is
  research software: it is not a medical device and must not be used for clinical
  decision-making. Partially funded by BMFTR, project fit4translation (FKZ 01ZZ2310A).
title: FRAMED
abstract: >-
  A service-oriented Java framework for acquiring and integrating multi-rate,
  multi-device medical event-data streams. Services communicate over an event bus
  and are wired together from JSON configuration at startup.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-05
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/rwth-imi/FRAMED"
